# Public evidence requirements

## Component EvidenceRequirements

View:
    <div class="evidence">
      <div class="evidence-item"><span>Source snapshot</span><strong>Required</strong></div>
      <div class="evidence-item"><span>Evidence bundle</span><strong>Required</strong></div>
      <div class="evidence-item"><span>Independent review</span><strong>Required</strong></div>
      <div class="evidence-item"><span>Decision record</span><strong>Required</strong></div>
    </div>

Style:
    .evidence {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));
        gap: 10px;
        margin-top: 30px;
    }
    .evidence-item {
        padding: 14px;
        background: #f2efe7;
        border-radius: 10px;
    }
    .evidence-item span {
        display: block;
        color: #758087;
        font-size: 10px;
    }
    .evidence-item strong {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 6px;
        color: #263d48;
        font-size: 12px;
    }
